# The Antique Collector (jeuno 25): Port Jeuno's Imasuke (no script; default 12; The Circle of Time wants a BRD). A
# level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 2 ((100 + 0 + 0) / 2 = 50), two Kaiser Swords and a Chocobo Feather. Available:
# the sword traded: no trade handler, nothing; 13, option 0: nothing; 13, option 1: begun. Accepted: 14; two swords:
# nil; the sword and the feather: nil; the sword: 15, finished: completed (2000 exp, 2000 gil, the Map of Delkfutt's
# Tower, Trader of Antiquities), fame +10 x3, the sword taken. Completed: no section (12; a trade: nothing). The
# replies' kinds: #circle.
lists PortJeuno/Imasuke/onTrigger PortJeuno/Imasuke/onTrade PortJeuno/onEventFinish/13 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/15
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-164.3,11,96.4 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 100
item KaiserSword
item KaiserSword
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Imasuke KaiserSword x1            # available: no trade handler: nothing, the sword kept
trigger Imasuke                         # fame level 2: 13
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Imasuke                         # 13
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Imasuke                         # accepted: 14
finish
trade Imasuke KaiserSword x2            # two: nil
trade Imasuke KaiserSword x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: nil
trade Imasuke KaiserSword x1            # 15
finish                                  # completed: 2000 exp, 2000 gil, the map, the title; fame +10 x3; the sword taken
trigger Imasuke                         # completed: no section; 12
finish
trade Imasuke KaiserSword x1            # completed: no trade handler: nothing, the sword kept
